		<p>Push the switch to turn the light on or off.</p>
		<ul id="e01966">
			<li>
				<p><image href="images/WKIA_070.jpg" scale="15" align="center" placement="inline"/>: Press this button to turn the light on.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p><image href="images/WKIA_074.jpg" scale="15" align="center" placement="inline"/>: Press this button to turn the light off.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="note" id="e01967">
			<p>Vanity mirror lamp</p>
			<p>Always close the vanity mirror and turn it off when not in use. If you close the sun visor with the vanity light on, this may damage the sun visor or cause the 12V battery to discharge.</p>
		</note>
